            {
                "text": "今天是開學第一天！<br>主角在校門口遇到同學，他們在說什麼呢？"
            },
            {
                "text": "tuko’un su ngan?",
                "textCh": "你叫甚麼名字？",
                "sound": "text/sound/62532/867301",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.jpg"
            },
            {
                "text": "Tiang cak.",
                "textCh": "我叫Tiang。",
                "sound": "text/sound/62532/867302",
                "image": "boy.png",
                "background": "1-2.jpg"
            },
            {
                "text": "ica su a lumaq?",
                "textCh": "你的家在哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/62532/867303",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.jpg"
            },
            {
                "text": "minihan cak Malavi’.",
                "textCh": "我從潭南部落來。",
